flowchart TB
    developer[Developer] --> pr[Pull request]
    pr --> same_repo{Same-repository PR?}
    same_repo -->|No| fork_validation[Tests, linting, security scans,<br/>and Terraform init -backend=false]
    same_repo -->|Yes| checks_start[Required PR checks]

    subgraph pull_request_checks[Pull-request checks]
        frontend_ci[Frontend tests and linting]
        backend_ci[Backend tests and linting]
        snyk[Snyk dependency scan]
        sonar[SonarQube quality and security analysis]
        trivy[Trivy repository, secret, and IaC scans]
        terraform_checks[Terraform format, validate, and TFLint]
    end

    checks_start --> frontend_ci
    checks_start --> backend_ci
    checks_start --> snyk
    checks_start --> sonar
    checks_start --> trivy
    checks_start --> terraform_checks
    frontend_ci --> merge[Protected merge to main]
    backend_ci --> merge
    snyk --> merge
    sonar --> merge
    trivy --> merge
    terraform_checks --> merge

    merge --> change{Changed scope}
    change -->|Frontend or backend| build[Build changed image]
    build --> image_trivy[Trivy image gate]
    image_trivy --> ecr[Push immutable digest to matching private ECR repository]
    ecr --> handoff[Upload seven-day digest-handoff artifact]
    manual_bootstrap[Workflow dispatch:<br/>select component, digest, source commit, and confirm] --> validate_digest[Reject invalid/all-zero digest or invalid SHA;<br/>verify matching ECR repository and immutable SHA tag]
    validate_digest --> bootstrap_sandbox[GitHub environment: sandbox<br/>Terraform apply role]
    bootstrap_sandbox --> bootstrap[Apply matching service root<br/>to create initial ECS service]

    manual_plan[Workflow dispatch:<br/>select target] --> plan_sandbox[GitHub environment: sandbox<br/>read-only plan role]
    plan_sandbox --> rendered_plan[Create and upload rendered plan]
    manual_apply[Workflow dispatch:<br/>select target and confirm] --> fresh_plan[Resolve immutable main commit<br/>and create fresh plan]
    fresh_plan --> terraform_sandbox[GitHub environment: sandbox]
    terraform_sandbox --> apply[Apply that exact plan]
